{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a factory that gets increasingly automated. The output of the factory is used to create and upgrade a planet-splitting drill that consumes massive amounts of energy. Craft Combat Units and watch them fight for control over enemy controlled sites like Power Plants. Provide Combat Units as upkeep for the sites, all via logistics. Balance your production carefully with energy consumption and automate everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075990/extras/e9bb1763ca7d585d135f58cde45cb0cc.avif?t=1760722079\" width=780 height=138 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Start small with manual mining and grow your factory to automate everything</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075990/extras/a081eb09ebf08dec436bee4d1cd1b70c.poster.avif?t=1760722079\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075990/extras/a081eb09ebf08dec436bee4d1cd1b70c.webm?t=1760722079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075990/extras/a081eb09ebf08dec436bee4d1cd1b70c.mp4?t=1760722079\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075990/extras/5ce67415c91e49f1911aa925deb3691f.avif?t=1760722079\" width=780 height=138 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The procedurally generated sandbox worlds allow you to create your own factory layout in any way imaginable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragrap